    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/kindgrove-steps/calculate-indices/actions/inherited-description-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "processDescription.inherited.json added with the attachment to the Implementation Profile radiometric-index-single-band: the deployed processDescription with each bound input and output linked to the role it implements (metadata, role implementation-input or implementation-output) and carrying that role's dataType; the profile schema inherits it. The deployed processDescription is unchanged." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/kindgrove-steps/calculate-indices> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/kindgrove-steps/calculate-indices/actions/plan-2026-11-11> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "plan: executionUnit.href moves from the v0.0.2-rc2 release of GeoLabs/KindGrove to the v0.0.2-rc3 release (mangrove-workflow-steps.cwl#calculate_indices). The rc3 CWL declares the format of its Files (the ipython2cwl format annotation), so the processDescription derived from it changes: contentMediaType application/octet-stream -> image/tiff; application=geotiff (with contentEncoding binary) for the input band_files and the outputs ndvi_file, ndwi_file and savi_file, in processDescription.json and processDescription.inherited.json. The assumedFormatGaps recorded at the attachment on 2026-11-10 for band_files, ndvi_file, ndwi_file and savi_file were removed the same day, when the corrected CWL served these formats; the entry has none." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-11T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/kindgrove-steps/calculate-indices> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

